  "name": "Basics 7 · Macro Oscillator Keys",
  "description": "Play the on-screen keyboard (or MIDI) to hear the Macro Oscillator, a 24-engine voice. Turn the Model knob to step through all 24 engines, and try Harmonics, Timbre and Morph on each; a slow LFO gently moves the timbre.",
